      <activity id="29026df5-43b6-5236-97b3-0627efd42952" activityNameId="d25db06c-08da-55e8-b33f-ee30b89fbff2" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Concrete for drilled piles, CEM II, A, NPK H (P1), 66% RC-C, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Concrete for drilled piles, CEM II, A, NPK H (P1), 66% RC-C, at plant
 Industry data from Eberhard Bau AG regarding the water, gravel, sand, cement, RC-M/RC-C content and the density.\nTechnology: Industry data. Data approximates average swiss production\nTime period: Time of publications.\nVersion: 1\nEnergy values: Undefined\nLocal category: Mineralische Baustoffe\nLocal subcategory: Beton und Betonwaren\nUVEK 2022 source file:551-Zement-Klinker_v0.10._6 Datensätze.xml\n\n
UUID: d0a47dfe-f377-30b3-8e34-b799d9b0eabe
The activity starts with the ingredients for the concrete at the factory gate. Includes the whole manufacturing processes to produce ready-mixed concrete, internal processes (transport, etc.) and infrastructure. No administration is included.
Location: undefined
Technology: Industry data. Data approximates average swiss production
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Measured data of several Swiss plants, intended to be representative for the Swiss production volume 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_d0a47dfe-f377-30b3-8e34-b799d9b0eabe.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
